{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛少し切りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ巻いてるので短く見える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/11/02/8653449/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今さっき、少しだけポケモンをしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんが貸してくれたよ(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんはアマルスが好きだそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今も隣でピコピコとポケモンしてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ポケモンゲットだぜー！」って叫んでます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから今日は、ゆったんが携帯を落として無理やり拾わされました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら頭なでなでしてくれたよ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんとはいつもこんな感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本ふざけ合ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の乃木どこ？でメンバーの実態調査が放送されるのですが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石はひどいです。笑"},{"type":"break